%% Capture (J-001): proposals are confirmed in the Claude Code conversation; the capture server validates before writing.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Author
  participant CC as Claude Code
  participant Cap as Capture server (MCP, stdio)
  participant Store as Concept files

  Author->>CC: Capture "Secure cookie attribute"
  CC->>Cap: list_concepts
  Cap->>Store: read frontmatter of all concepts
  Cap-->>CC: ids, titles, layers
  CC-->>Author: proposed relations with sources, SEE-I draft, layer and facets
  Author->>CC: keep relations, write one explanation each, accept or rewrite each SEE-I part
  CC-->>Author: proposed recall questions
  Author->>CC: confirm questions, name the episode
  CC->>Cap: save_concept(concept)
  alt every rule holds (BR-001 to BR-005)
    Cap->>Store: write temp file, rename into place
    Cap-->>CC: saved
    CC-->>Author: saved, first review due tomorrow
  else a rule fails
    Cap-->>CC: rejected: the exact field or relation (UX-003)
    CC-->>Author: what to fix
  end
